Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 02:10:30 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Chat (Global/Party tabs), parties via avatar interaction (max
 3), party vitals panel

- engine: TextEdit 'autoFocus' prop so a script can open a text input without a click
- relay: global channel + parties (invite/accept/decline/leave, size cap, expiry), global/party chat routing
- player.lua: chat box, party panel with health/magicka/fatigue bars, invite banner, avatar menu
- global.lua: everyone is an avatar; party state, vitals, invites, chat plumbing; [mp-dbg] visibility logging
- owner_bot.py/run-test.sh updated; debug/ opt-in cheat mod (max stats + weapon) for combat tests

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
